## Releases

[release-please](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please) keeps a release PR open with the
next version and changelog. Merging it tags `vX.Y.Z` and publishes a GitHub Release.

One-time setup, or the Release workflow fails at its token step:

1. Install the release GitHub App on this repository.
2. Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions: add the variable `RELEASE_APP_CLIENT_ID` and the
   secret `RELEASE_APP_PRIVATE_KEY`.
